WEBVTT

01:44.840 --> 01:45.479
Yiren!

01:49.870 --> 01:52.759
The Tribulation Finger
on each of you has been detoxified.

01:52.759 --> 01:54.120
Those who choose not to believe us

01:54.120 --> 01:56.580
may take their share
of the reward and leave.

01:59.229 --> 01:59.950
Mr. Xiao,

02:00.840 --> 02:02.040
you saved us

02:02.280 --> 02:04.070
in our moment of peril yesterday.

02:04.070 --> 02:06.350
What is your take on his words?

02:08.190 --> 02:10.520
Li Chenzhou is profoundly unfathomable.

02:10.630 --> 02:13.490
It would be unwise
to confront him at this juncture,

02:13.960 --> 02:16.090
and victory would be far from certain.

02:17.590 --> 02:19.840
Aiding the border garrisons
is our most urgent priority.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.400
May these treasures suffice

02:21.400 --> 02:23.600
for the needs of our frontier warriors.

02:24.079 --> 02:26.520
To all gathered here today
at Nantian Abyss—

02:26.520 --> 02:29.240
including us, the Xiao family—we ask that

02:30.240 --> 02:32.079
you temporarily set aside your grievances
with the Power Gang.

02:32.079 --> 02:32.840
Chief Li,

02:33.710 --> 02:36.710
if you wish to earn the respect
of the entire martial world,

02:36.710 --> 02:39.910
then let all witnesses
hold you to your words today.

02:40.240 --> 02:42.310
May your actions match your promises.

02:42.310 --> 02:42.960
Great!

02:43.800 --> 02:44.840
It's a deal.

02:48.190 --> 02:49.650
Since Mr. Xiao has spoken,

02:49.870 --> 02:51.960
my Haisha Gang will honor this request.

02:51.960 --> 02:52.910
Today, my Haisha Gang
relinquishes all claim to our reward

02:52.910 --> 02:54.280
and dedicate them

02:54.520 --> 02:56.280
entirely to the frontier soldiers.

02:56.280 --> 02:58.310
Our Baibu Sect waives our share as well.

02:58.310 --> 02:59.150
We too waive ours.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.150
-We too waive ours.
-Right!

03:00.150 --> 03:02.080
-Right!
-We will waive ours!

03:02.080 --> 03:03.080
I... I won't take any.

03:03.080 --> 03:03.870
-Allocate all to the border garrisons!
-All to the border!

03:03.870 --> 03:05.280
-Allocate all to the border garrisons!
-All to the border!

03:05.280 --> 03:06.470
-All to the border!
-All to the border!

03:06.470 --> 03:08.520
-All to the border!
-We can't take it.

03:08.520 --> 03:09.450
We'll donate it!

03:10.120 --> 03:11.310
-All to the front line!
-All to the border!

03:11.310 --> 03:12.370
-Yes!
-All to them!

03:12.710 --> 03:15.040
-All to the front line!
-All to the border!

03:17.120 --> 03:17.710
Help out.

03:18.360 --> 03:18.960
Take this.

03:20.120 --> 03:21.050
And this one too.

03:22.190 --> 03:22.850
Be careful.

03:23.150 --> 03:24.560
Careful. Let's go.

03:25.470 --> 03:26.530
It's really heavy!

03:27.710 --> 03:28.870
Be careful not to spill it.

03:28.870 --> 03:29.360
Here!

03:32.360 --> 03:33.400
-Be careful.
-Yes.

03:33.400 --> 03:33.910
Right!

03:54.190 --> 03:56.790
What are you sneaking around here
looking for?

04:05.870 --> 04:06.600
Li Chenzhou.

04:07.030 --> 04:08.360
What do you mean by this?

04:11.280 --> 04:12.540
Check it for yourself.

04:17.070 --> 04:18.269
Northern Wastelander!

04:18.269 --> 04:19.600
Northern Wastelander?

04:20.600 --> 04:21.800
How is that possible?

04:23.310 --> 04:26.040
These Northern Wastelanders
were brought here by you.

04:26.040 --> 04:27.870
Perhaps you should be asking yourself
that question.

04:27.870 --> 04:28.870
Hold your tongue!

04:33.159 --> 04:35.000
How could you possibly be
Northern Wastelanders?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.510
Weren't you here
to help the Xiao family?

04:36.510 --> 04:38.390
You were the one who brought us here.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.480
You can't possibly be unaware of

04:39.480 --> 04:40.940
who we really are, can you?

04:42.560 --> 04:43.190
Yiren,

04:43.430 --> 04:45.090
what exactly is going on here?

04:45.159 --> 04:45.800
They are clearly

04:45.800 --> 04:48.159
new disciples we recruited
for the Xiao family!

04:48.159 --> 04:48.750
Yiren,

04:49.040 --> 04:50.970
someone is clearly setting you up.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.190
Speak!

05:06.560 --> 05:09.120
Why did you impersonate
disciples of the Xiao family

05:09.120 --> 05:12.630
and frame me as a Northern Wasteland spy?

05:13.270 --> 05:14.160
Why?

05:14.310 --> 05:15.720
A nobody like you

05:16.230 --> 05:18.560
isn't even worth the effort to frame.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.720
Xiao Yiren,

05:23.000 --> 05:24.830
I never imagined you would stoop so low

05:24.830 --> 05:26.480
as to collude
with the Northern Wastelanders.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.610
That's not how it is!

05:28.000 --> 05:28.630
No, they—

05:29.360 --> 05:31.630
they were supposed to help me

05:31.630 --> 05:33.070
restore the Xiao family!

05:33.560 --> 05:34.750
Why has it come to this?

05:34.750 --> 05:35.920
Why?

05:44.480 --> 05:45.830
Who are you really?

05:47.120 --> 05:49.040
Why are you doing this to me?

05:50.120 --> 05:51.270
Why!

05:58.310 --> 05:59.040
Big Brother.

05:59.190 --> 06:00.310
How do things stand?

06:00.310 --> 06:01.510
We've searched everywhere,

06:01.510 --> 06:03.370
but we still haven't found Yiren.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.870
Yiren would never collude
with the Northern Wastelanders.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.600
He must have fallen into a trap.

06:14.720 --> 06:16.320
Once the truth is uncovered,

06:16.800 --> 06:19.800
the Xiao family will give a full account
to everyone.

06:20.430 --> 06:23.160
-We can trust the Xiao family.
-We can trust them.

06:23.190 --> 06:24.430
The front line is under intense pressure.

06:24.430 --> 06:25.920
There's no more time to delay.

06:25.920 --> 06:28.120
If anyone is unwilling to assist

06:28.630 --> 06:31.290
in escorting the treasures,
they may leave now.

06:32.950 --> 06:33.680
Mr. Xiao,

06:34.190 --> 06:35.000
we trust you.

06:35.600 --> 06:37.920
We await your investigation
into this matter.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.920
Don't you look down on us, Power Gang!

06:39.920 --> 06:41.830
If Power Gang honors its pledge

06:42.070 --> 06:43.830
to deliver the treasures
to the front line,

06:43.830 --> 06:46.310
my Haisha Gang

06:46.480 --> 06:47.800
will mobilize all its resources
to contribute again in the future!

06:47.800 --> 06:49.600
Indeed, when Daxi's survival
is at stake,

06:49.600 --> 06:50.800
it is our duty to lend a hand!

06:50.800 --> 06:52.430
Let's just focus on
escorting the treasures first!

06:52.430 --> 06:53.800
-Right.
-Well said.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.800
-Yes.
-Let's escort the treasures!

06:56.560 --> 06:57.270
Mr. Xiao,

06:57.950 --> 07:00.210
our Chief has asked me to relay a message:

07:00.270 --> 07:01.510
we must trouble you

07:02.120 --> 07:05.520
to oversee the subsequent matters
regarding the treasures.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.460
As for your parents' remains,

07:07.600 --> 07:08.800
the Power Gang will
arrange for their return

07:08.800 --> 07:11.260
to the Xiao family once affairs
are settled.

07:14.510 --> 07:15.370
Let's move out!

07:17.680 --> 07:19.270
The Power Gang is just leaving like that?

07:19.270 --> 07:19.750
Right.

07:19.920 --> 07:21.720
Li Chenzhou is a man of profound cunning.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.750
He used this scheme
to eliminate his rivals

07:23.750 --> 07:25.750
while publicly presenting the treasures
to the border garrisons,

07:25.750 --> 07:28.150
winning the people's favor in the process.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.190
Mr. Xiao!

07:35.310 --> 07:36.570
Mr. Xiao, please stay!

07:37.480 --> 07:39.010
We must thank you once more.

07:39.159 --> 07:40.480
Had you not aided us

07:40.920 --> 07:42.430
in navigating the poisonous miasma
of Nantian Abyss,

07:42.430 --> 07:44.040
we would have surely perished.

07:44.040 --> 07:44.870
This life-saving grace

07:44.870 --> 07:46.270
is akin to a second birth.

07:46.750 --> 07:48.720
We beg you to accept our humble bow!

07:51.040 --> 07:51.830
Chief Sha,

07:52.430 --> 07:53.480
it was but a trivial effort—

07:53.480 --> 07:54.610
think nothing of it!

07:54.720 --> 07:55.360
Mr. Xiao,

07:56.159 --> 07:59.040
our Haisha Gang has long been overlooked
in the martial world.

07:59.040 --> 08:01.360
Having witnessed your capabilities today,

08:01.360 --> 08:02.750
if you would accept our allegiance,

08:02.750 --> 08:04.000
we vow to follow you

08:04.430 --> 08:05.360
through fire and water

08:05.360 --> 08:07.160
whenever you may have need of us!

08:10.270 --> 08:11.130
Thank you, all.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.640
Northern Wastelanders!

09:21.670 --> 09:22.670
Sect Leader Xiao,

09:23.240 --> 09:24.900
I sent my people to assist you.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.360
Why then do you draw your blade
against them?

09:27.360 --> 09:29.440
You deceived me
into leading the Northern Wastelanders

09:29.440 --> 09:31.630
to Nantian Abyss
to seize the treasures.

09:31.630 --> 09:33.000
Just who are you?

09:33.960 --> 09:34.720
Xiao Yiren,

09:35.240 --> 09:37.100
who I am is of little consequence.

09:37.670 --> 09:38.550
What matters is

09:39.270 --> 09:42.510
that aligning with me
is now your only path forward.

09:42.670 --> 09:45.670
What exactly are you scheming
by using the Xiao family

09:45.870 --> 09:48.000
to lure the Northern Wastelanders
into Nantian Abyss?

09:48.000 --> 09:49.840
Sect Leader Xiao, you may not be aware,

09:49.840 --> 09:51.720
but when the Northern Wastelanders
breached the capital,

09:51.720 --> 09:53.200
Daxi's imperial jade seal

09:53.200 --> 09:55.910
vanished along with that treasure trove.

09:56.510 --> 09:58.150
If we can recover the seal now

09:58.320 --> 09:59.840
and return it to its rightful place,

09:59.840 --> 10:02.960
you would be performing
a great service for Daxi!

10:02.960 --> 10:03.600
What?

10:05.440 --> 10:08.030
Are you saying the Northern Wastelanders
stole the jade seal

10:08.030 --> 10:09.630
to present it to the Emperor?

10:11.600 --> 10:13.130
How could that be possible!

10:14.840 --> 10:16.150
Having long lived in the martial world,

10:16.150 --> 10:18.670
you might struggle
to grasp the intricacies of court affairs.

10:18.670 --> 10:19.730
But consider this:

10:20.120 --> 10:21.720
if the Northern Wastelanders

10:21.720 --> 10:23.360
were to return the jade seal
to His Majesty,

10:23.360 --> 10:25.360
transforming conflict into harmony,

10:25.360 --> 10:28.030
wouldn't that spare the people
from the ravages of war?

10:28.030 --> 10:30.150
Isn't it a truly auspicious outcome!

10:30.670 --> 10:32.320
And what about the lands
north of the river?

10:32.320 --> 10:34.440
Would they not be forever lost,

10:35.670 --> 10:36.960
dashing any hope of reunifying Daxi?

10:36.960 --> 10:39.600
Recovering lost territory
is merely a fantasy

10:39.600 --> 10:41.200
held by you martial artists.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.000
In truth, His Majesty

10:42.000 --> 10:44.630
has no desire for war
with the Northern Wastelanders—

10:44.630 --> 10:46.480
he merely lacks an opportunity

10:46.480 --> 10:47.840
for reconciliation.

10:48.510 --> 10:49.510
Sect Leader Xiao,

10:50.720 --> 10:53.080
this presents you with a perfect chance

10:53.150 --> 10:55.030
to foster peace between both sides

10:55.030 --> 10:57.200
and fulfill the Emperor's wishes.

10:58.000 --> 10:59.200
If that were the case,

11:00.390 --> 11:01.790
wouldn't our Xiao family

11:02.910 --> 11:04.770
be condemned throughout history

11:05.360 --> 11:07.360
as traitors who sold out the nation?

11:07.720 --> 11:08.960
The affairs of the empire

11:08.960 --> 11:11.390
are far beyond your concerns, Xiao Yiren.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.270
Should His Majesty be pleased,

11:13.270 --> 11:15.400
he will richly reward the Xiao family.

11:15.630 --> 11:16.390
By then,

11:16.600 --> 11:19.750
even granting the Huanhua Sect
an imperial plaque would be effortless.

11:19.750 --> 11:21.480
With that, not only
the martial world of Jindu

11:21.480 --> 11:22.960
but even the martial world
of the Central Plains

11:22.960 --> 11:25.090
would have to defer to the Xiao family.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.720
Who are you really!

11:29.360 --> 11:31.150
Just who are you?

11:40.200 --> 11:41.910
Excellent, you're all back!

11:42.360 --> 11:42.910
Qiushui!

11:44.150 --> 11:46.200
Big Brother! You've finally returned!

11:46.200 --> 11:46.930
You're back!

11:48.150 --> 11:49.360
We've been waiting for you for so long.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.890
Look, everything is built!

11:56.630 --> 11:58.360
It's exactly the same as it was.

11:59.240 --> 12:01.000
Are you satisfied, Mr. Xiao?

12:02.870 --> 12:06.270
I, Xiao Qiushui, extend my
deepest gratitude for your assistance!

12:06.270 --> 12:07.630
Mr. Xiao,
there's no need for such courtesy.

12:07.630 --> 12:09.490
From now on, we are all one family.

12:09.550 --> 12:11.200
The martial sects of Guangling
are at the disposal

12:11.200 --> 12:13.440
of the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

12:14.670 --> 12:15.960
Mr. Xiao, since you are satisfied,

12:15.960 --> 12:17.360
we can rest assured then.

12:17.630 --> 12:18.750
We'll take our leave now!

12:18.750 --> 12:21.480
-We take our leave!
-After you, we take our leave!

12:25.320 --> 12:26.050
Big Brother,

12:26.390 --> 12:27.670
come quickly to the training ground

12:27.670 --> 12:29.750
and see what I've built with my own hands!

12:29.750 --> 12:30.210
Hold on,

12:30.720 --> 12:32.510
what do you mean
you built it with your own hands?

12:32.510 --> 12:34.510
This was a joint effort by everyone.

12:34.510 --> 12:36.440
Yes, true, everyone contributed.

12:36.630 --> 12:37.670
-They contributed too!
-Great!

12:37.670 --> 12:38.440
Then today,

12:38.750 --> 12:41.840
let's drink to our hearts' content!

12:43.120 --> 12:44.650
Where can we find good wine?

12:44.790 --> 12:46.720
Wouldn't dream of leaving you out!

12:47.750 --> 12:48.550
But...

12:50.120 --> 12:51.000
Hero Zuoqiu.

12:51.600 --> 12:53.000
Why are you looking at me?

12:53.870 --> 12:56.670
I have matters to attend to.
I'll take my leave now.

13:01.240 --> 13:01.870
It's okay.

13:03.840 --> 13:04.630
Qiushui...

13:05.910 --> 13:06.550
Qiushui!

13:08.030 --> 13:08.790
Qiushui...

13:10.270 --> 13:11.080
Qiu...

13:12.030 --> 13:12.630
Kaiyan!

13:13.120 --> 13:13.600
Kaiyan!

13:19.550 --> 13:20.120
Kaiyan!

13:21.320 --> 13:22.030
Qiushui!

13:24.240 --> 13:25.120
How are you feeling now?

13:25.120 --> 13:26.450
How did you get injured?

13:26.550 --> 13:29.610
I went with Yiren
to pursue the Northern Wastelanders,

13:30.030 --> 13:31.790
but in the blink of an eye,

13:32.510 --> 13:33.960
Yiren vanished.

13:34.510 --> 13:36.790
The paths in Nantian Abyss
are treacherous,

13:36.790 --> 13:37.960
and I had no choice

13:38.600 --> 13:40.240
but to retreat on my own.

13:40.480 --> 13:42.740
Third Young Master! Third Young Master!

13:43.870 --> 13:44.510
Zhao Shirong has arrived

13:44.510 --> 13:46.370
with the remains of your parents.

14:18.790 --> 14:19.670
Mother.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.510
Father!

14:30.360 --> 14:31.200
Mother!

14:37.550 --> 14:38.390
Father!

14:40.630 --> 14:41.720
Mother.

14:49.080 --> 14:51.270
Z—Zhao Shirong!

14:56.320 --> 14:57.550
Your Power Gang

14:58.790 --> 15:02.390
has brought ruin to my Xiao family,
leaving us broken and bereft.

15:02.480 --> 15:06.630
and now you dare come here
with my parents' remains?

15:07.360 --> 15:08.360
I, Xiao Kaiyan,

15:09.320 --> 15:12.120
swear to have my revenge
for this blood debt!

15:15.600 --> 15:16.840
Kaiyan! Kaiyan!

15:21.150 --> 15:22.200
Everyone, hold!

15:24.000 --> 15:25.460
She was sent by Li Chenzhou

15:27.200 --> 15:29.200
to return our parents' remains.

15:37.000 --> 15:37.670
Kaiyan,

15:39.120 --> 15:40.380
back in Nantian Abyss,

15:40.960 --> 15:42.090
Li Chenzhou claimed

15:42.550 --> 15:44.960
that the Power Gang was not
responsible for

15:46.440 --> 15:49.440
the deaths of our parents
and the Xiao family members.

15:51.150 --> 15:51.840
He said

15:53.390 --> 15:55.320
the true culprit was someone else.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.000
Qiushui,

16:00.200 --> 16:02.120
the Power Gang is the culprit.

16:03.080 --> 16:05.680
How could you let yourself
be deceived by them?

16:06.510 --> 16:07.480
He showed me

16:08.840 --> 16:10.440
evidence I couldn't refute.

16:11.150 --> 16:12.480
Li Chenzhou promised me

16:13.720 --> 16:15.250
that within 3 days, he would

16:16.200 --> 16:18.330
bring our parents' remains back to us.

16:19.030 --> 16:20.240
He also swore

16:21.550 --> 16:22.510
he would expose

16:23.630 --> 16:27.000
the true mastermind behind their murders.

16:34.360 --> 16:36.020
Since everyone is here today,

16:40.480 --> 16:41.240
tell us—

16:42.510 --> 16:45.550
what else did Li Chenzhou say?

16:46.550 --> 16:49.880
Your parents were killed
by the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.320
Marrow-Disrupting Finger?

16:55.270 --> 16:57.000
What kind of nonsense is that?

16:57.750 --> 16:59.000
This technique was left behind

16:59.000 --> 16:59.870
decades ago

16:59.870 --> 17:01.550
by the Old Master of Tuoshan.

17:02.270 --> 17:03.030
Qiushui,

17:03.870 --> 17:06.160
Qiushui, don't listen to her excuses.

17:06.680 --> 17:09.160
She's only trying
to absolve the Power Gang—

17:10.640 --> 17:12.069
you mustn't believe her!

17:12.960 --> 17:14.420
The iron sand is the proof.

17:17.829 --> 17:19.290
Using the Two Form Needle,

17:19.349 --> 17:21.680
I've forced the iron sands,
left by the Marrow-Disrupting Finger,

17:21.680 --> 17:23.140
to gather at their wrists.

17:23.550 --> 17:24.950
You may see for yourself.

17:50.030 --> 17:52.750
Are you saying
this Marrow-Disrupting Finger technique

17:52.750 --> 17:55.590
was passed down decades ago
by the Old Master of Tuoshan?

17:55.590 --> 17:56.400
So who did he

17:56.830 --> 17:58.630
pass the technique to back then?

18:00.400 --> 18:01.720
From what I've uncovered,

18:01.720 --> 18:03.450
he only had 3 direct disciples,

18:03.880 --> 18:05.240
each from 3 prominent

18:05.550 --> 18:07.150
southern martial families.

18:08.070 --> 18:11.110
The first was from the Fei family,
one of the Three Great Mystical Sects.

18:11.110 --> 18:14.000
The second was from the Deng family

18:14.310 --> 18:16.370
of the Qianxi Division, Hailin Sect.

18:17.750 --> 18:18.510
My family?

18:19.440 --> 18:20.240
Zhao Shirong,

18:20.480 --> 18:22.880
do you have proof
for what you're claiming?

18:24.000 --> 18:24.640
Yuhan.

18:31.400 --> 18:32.600
And who was the third?

18:35.110 --> 18:36.910
The third was from the Tang Sect.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.160
Indeed,

18:40.960 --> 18:42.890
this technique is extremely rigid

18:42.960 --> 18:44.760
and can only be practiced by men.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.270
Within the Tang Sect,

18:49.270 --> 18:51.720
the one who cultivated it is Tang Yaoshun.

19:02.750 --> 19:04.010
Don't misunderstand!

19:04.590 --> 19:06.720
My father has been bedridden for years

19:06.720 --> 19:09.250
and hasn't left the Tang Sect
in nearly a year.

19:09.510 --> 19:11.030
The Marrow-Disrupting Finger technique

19:11.030 --> 19:14.960
requires mobilizing
all of one's internal energy,

19:15.830 --> 19:17.550
so it's impossible for it
to have been my father.

19:17.550 --> 19:18.400
Indeed,

19:18.960 --> 19:21.200
Tang Yaoshun's internal energy
is now greatly diminished—

19:21.200 --> 19:23.720
it's impossible for him to have executed
the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

19:23.720 --> 19:26.200
Therefore, the murderer of your parents

19:26.920 --> 19:29.250
must be from
one of the other two families.

19:32.310 --> 19:34.000
he practitioner from the Fei family

19:34.000 --> 19:36.590
is its sect leader, Fei Yuqiao.

19:37.350 --> 19:39.750
From the Deng family, it is Deng Qingfeng.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.210
Big Brother,

19:42.590 --> 19:44.590
I have never seen my father
use this technique,

19:44.590 --> 19:47.440
nor have I ever heard of him
studying under the Old Master of Tuoshan!

19:47.440 --> 19:48.200
Yuhan,

19:49.790 --> 19:52.070
I don't believe your father
would harm the Xiao family.

19:52.070 --> 19:53.000
In that case,

19:53.720 --> 19:56.200
I shall seek out Fei Yuqiao
of the Fei family first.

19:56.200 --> 19:58.680
Testing his skills will reveal the truth.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.200
Hold on.

20:02.270 --> 20:03.160
Before you depart,

20:03.160 --> 20:05.760
Mr. Xiao, there is a place
you must visit first.

20:05.920 --> 20:08.240
Chenzhou said he has urgent matters
to discuss with you.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.370
I must ask you to come

20:09.480 --> 20:11.680
to the Power Gang's main headquarters.

20:16.750 --> 20:20.950
This will grant you unrestricted access
to the Power Gang's headquarters.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.880
I will take my leave.

20:41.880 --> 20:42.550
Kaiyan,

20:44.350 --> 20:47.160
our parents deserve to be laid
to rest as soon as possible.

20:47.160 --> 20:49.290
Could you make a trip down the mountain

20:49.510 --> 20:50.840
to prepare the coffins?

20:51.880 --> 20:53.940
Also, please inform Yiren and Xueyu.

20:54.590 --> 20:56.320
Big Brother, we'll go help too.

21:14.400 --> 21:16.200
Please accept our condolences.

21:25.750 --> 21:29.070
You agreed to go to the
Power Gang's headquarters just like that?

21:29.070 --> 21:31.200
Aren't you afraid they might harm you?

21:32.200 --> 21:33.660
Perhaps it's for the best—

21:34.480 --> 21:36.880
this might allow us
to uncover other clues.

21:37.110 --> 21:38.040
Then be careful!

22:14.400 --> 22:15.110
Mother!

22:17.240 --> 22:18.030
Father!

22:20.720 --> 22:22.790
I've finally found you!

22:37.880 --> 22:40.350
I've finally found you!

23:30.350 --> 23:31.790
I have a wild thought.

23:32.200 --> 23:33.830
Could it be that someone else here

23:33.830 --> 23:35.310
shares my experience?

23:36.070 --> 23:39.530
Perhaps someone else has also
transmigrated into this story.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.270
Reset it then!

23:47.830 --> 23:48.830
Reset.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.640
Buff the character
with more golden cheats.

23:50.640 --> 23:51.350
Reset.

23:59.640 --> 24:00.830
Did you forget his catchphrase?

24:00.830 --> 24:02.310
Reset! Reset!

24:02.400 --> 24:04.270
Reset! Reset! Reset!

24:24.880 --> 24:25.480
Mingming,

24:26.160 --> 24:27.510
today's the deadline
for topic submissions.

24:27.510 --> 24:29.110
Why haven't you shown up yet?

24:48.110 --> 24:48.970
You can do this!

25:33.590 --> 25:35.790
I've been staying up
past 10 PM every night reading—

25:35.790 --> 25:37.790
it's so addictive!
Can we get an extra chapter?

25:37.790 --> 25:39.590
This chapter has only 2,000 words.

25:39.590 --> 25:40.510
I need more!

25:40.720 --> 25:42.270
The romance subplot
could use some work…

25:42.270 --> 25:44.030
Last night's update
was absolutely god-tier!

25:44.030 --> 25:45.790
You're definitely
topping the monthly rankings this time!

25:45.790 --> 25:46.830
The plot's solid,

25:46.920 --> 25:49.580
though the romance subplot
could use some work…

25:49.590 --> 25:51.510
The enchanting senior sisters?
Absolutely perfect!

25:51.510 --> 25:53.640
Nanda, I love you!

25:55.030 --> 25:55.790
Nanda!

25:57.830 --> 25:58.960
Utterly shameless!

25:59.200 --> 26:00.730
You're nothing but a fraud!

26:03.510 --> 26:05.960
Hero Xiao, you truly live up
to being a martial arts prodigy!

26:05.960 --> 26:08.490
Thirty-one weeks
atop the monthly rankings,

26:09.680 --> 26:11.960
and only you could pull that off!

26:13.110 --> 26:14.070
You deserve an extra chicken drumstick!

26:14.070 --> 26:15.470
I don't like drumsticks.

26:16.270 --> 26:18.330
Hey, kids shouldn't be picky eaters!

26:19.310 --> 26:20.350
Nanda!

26:21.750 --> 26:22.880
All this screeching

26:22.960 --> 26:24.830
can only mean one thing:
Nanda is making a grand entrance!

26:24.830 --> 26:26.270
Same dramatic antics every time!

26:26.270 --> 26:29.400
What a riot! And he has the nerve
to enjoy the screeching!

26:30.160 --> 26:31.490
Keep it down, he's here!

26:32.400 --> 26:33.790
So this is Nanda's studio?

26:33.790 --> 26:36.030
The aesthetic is so classy!

26:36.070 --> 26:38.030
Senior, I just finished
the latest chapter of "Chief".

26:38.030 --> 26:38.880
It was incredible!

26:38.880 --> 26:40.480
I was up all night reading it!

26:40.590 --> 26:41.790
Good morning, Mr. Li.

26:43.920 --> 26:44.440
Mr. Li.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.110
Thanks for your hard work.

26:50.110 --> 26:50.960
Not at all.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.310
Just doing my job.

26:55.030 --> 26:55.830
It's so stylish, isn't it?

26:55.830 --> 26:56.270
Exactly!

26:56.270 --> 26:56.960
Keep at it,

26:57.160 --> 26:58.360
and you'll get there!

27:02.350 --> 27:03.640
Chinese Literature Department
is something else—

27:03.640 --> 27:05.000
a real powerhouse of talents.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.310
As soon as one group graduates,

27:06.310 --> 27:08.640
another pops up, seamlessly taking over!

27:09.350 --> 27:11.280
Wasn't I just one of them back then?

27:13.000 --> 27:14.920
Alas!

27:17.270 --> 27:18.330
I, unworthy Li Cai,

27:18.680 --> 27:19.960
will take my leave.

27:20.750 --> 27:22.950
He's nothing but a complete con artist!

27:30.750 --> 27:31.480
You're here.

27:33.310 --> 27:34.310
Let me have a look.

27:35.550 --> 27:36.950
A pure martial arts story

27:39.790 --> 27:41.160
with patriotic fervor—

27:41.720 --> 27:43.120
that's not a bad concept.

27:43.550 --> 27:44.960
Though this genre...

27:47.510 --> 27:48.110
Ah, right!

27:48.310 --> 27:51.110
I just brought back two boxes of tea
from out of town.

27:51.110 --> 27:52.710
I'll have you try some later.

27:53.720 --> 27:54.400
Senior.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.400
Thank you.

27:57.960 --> 28:00.310
As we discussed earlier,

28:01.640 --> 28:03.570
if the Chief's metrics are strong,

28:04.070 --> 28:05.030
the company will formally

28:05.030 --> 28:06.630
offer me an author contract.

28:06.920 --> 28:08.650
The metrics are indeed strong,

28:08.680 --> 28:10.410
but you seem a bit tired lately.

28:10.680 --> 28:12.200
The update pace has slowed,

28:12.200 --> 28:13.550
and readers are starting to comment.

28:13.550 --> 28:14.400
How about this:

28:14.400 --> 28:17.070
draft a few more chapters
of Li the Immortal's storyline?

28:17.070 --> 28:18.000
That arc has better momentum.

28:18.000 --> 28:19.880
But Li the Immortal
has already been written off the story!

28:19.880 --> 28:21.440
Reset it then!

28:21.720 --> 28:22.440
Reset it.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.200
Reset.

28:25.350 --> 28:26.160
Trust me,

28:26.680 --> 28:29.140
buff the character
with more golden cheats.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.570
Readers love it!

28:31.000 --> 28:33.000
Readers do love a good golden cheat,

28:33.070 --> 28:34.880
but we can't just abuse it randomly.

28:34.880 --> 28:35.550
Check this.

28:39.200 --> 28:41.310
Hmm... let me think it over a bit more.

28:44.200 --> 28:47.800
I still really want to
stick to writing pure martial arts novels.

28:48.000 --> 28:50.070
There you go again, stubborn as ever.

28:50.750 --> 28:52.680
I know you have strong visions
when you write,

28:52.680 --> 28:53.940
and you're tenacious.

28:53.960 --> 28:56.160
That's why I've always believed in you.

28:56.480 --> 28:57.640
Having lost your parents early,

28:57.640 --> 28:59.970
you came straight to me after university.

29:00.030 --> 29:01.960
I see you as my own younger brother.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.220
Just focus on writing.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.370
Don't overthink it.

29:10.920 --> 29:11.550
Mr. Li,

29:11.960 --> 29:14.110
you have been allocated a place
in the military forum.

29:14.110 --> 29:15.750
The visit is scheduled for this week

29:15.750 --> 29:17.030
under confidential conditions.

29:17.030 --> 29:19.400
I will proceed
to arrange your itinerary then.

29:19.400 --> 29:20.590
Okay, got it.

29:43.480 --> 29:44.830
Isn't this my novel?

29:50.270 --> 29:51.200
Sure it is.

29:52.790 --> 29:53.850
What are you doing?

29:54.070 --> 29:55.030
Don't charge in there!

29:55.030 --> 29:56.000
The place is swarming with media—

29:56.000 --> 29:57.640
official accounts, influencers,
verified megablogs…

29:57.640 --> 29:59.700
Are you trying to trend on headlines?

30:00.830 --> 30:01.750
But "Chief II" uses the outline

30:01.750 --> 30:03.030
for my new book!

30:03.310 --> 30:04.350
Isn't it obvious?

30:04.350 --> 30:05.110
He just wants to keep you

30:05.110 --> 30:07.310
as the man behind the scenes permanently.

30:07.310 --> 30:08.640
Enough with
this "man behind the scenes" talk.

30:08.640 --> 30:10.500
I don't get it, and I don't care to.

30:10.590 --> 30:11.920
Yes, he's utterly shameless!

30:11.920 --> 30:14.110
But have you forgotten his catchphrase?

30:14.110 --> 30:15.160
Reset!

30:15.400 --> 30:16.750
Reset! Reset!

30:17.350 --> 30:17.920
Let me tell you:

30:17.920 --> 30:18.720
that computer in his office

30:18.720 --> 30:19.680
hasn't been booted up in ages.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.110
He's run out of ideas long ago!

30:21.110 --> 30:23.110
He's counting on you to reset him.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.200
Once everyone leaves,

30:24.200 --> 30:25.930
I will get to the bottom of this.

30:27.880 --> 30:31.140
Looks like you haven't endured
enough corporate life yet.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.440
Senior,

30:33.960 --> 30:35.490
the synopsis for "Chief II"

30:36.350 --> 30:38.350
is identical to my "Hero on the Way"!

30:39.510 --> 30:40.200
Mingming,

30:40.750 --> 30:42.110
you're overthinking this.

30:42.110 --> 30:43.030
I had "Chief II"

30:43.240 --> 30:45.200
planned out 6 months ago.

30:45.550 --> 30:46.480
Here we go again!

30:46.920 --> 30:48.790
You've been swamped with meetings

30:48.790 --> 30:50.000
and client dinners every single day
for the past 6 months.

30:50.000 --> 30:52.720
When did you even have time
to develop the concept?

30:52.720 --> 30:53.310
What?

30:53.720 --> 30:55.640
Are you suggesting
a web novel master like me

30:55.640 --> 30:57.640
would stoop to stealing your ideas?

30:58.310 --> 30:59.400
This is my novel.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.810
Listen carefully:

31:02.070 --> 31:04.070
I won't ghostwrite for you anymore.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.560
I demand credit for my work.

31:08.270 --> 31:08.920
Mingming,

31:09.510 --> 31:10.750
you don't seem to understand.

31:10.750 --> 31:12.440
The copyright holds real value

31:12.440 --> 31:13.590
only in my name.

31:13.880 --> 31:15.400
Who'd even notice otherwise?

31:15.400 --> 31:16.160
Besides,

31:16.400 --> 31:17.750
look at all you've written before.

31:17.750 --> 31:18.950
Did any of it take off?

31:19.310 --> 31:21.310
Young people need to stay grounded.

31:22.070 --> 31:23.800
I will give you opportunities.

31:27.070 --> 31:27.790
Senior,

31:30.160 --> 31:30.920
you used to be

31:32.880 --> 31:36.410
a role model for all of us
in the Chinese Literature Department.

31:36.830 --> 31:38.760
I hope you can be honest with me now.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.440
It's complicated,

31:46.350 --> 31:48.010
and you wouldn't understand.

31:53.030 --> 31:54.590
Besides, I have a meeting
to attend shortly.

31:54.590 --> 31:55.590
We'll talk later.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.550
Just accept it.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.110
Isn't this ideal?

32:04.480 --> 32:05.590
Being a ghostwriter means

32:05.590 --> 32:06.480
steady pay.

32:07.440 --> 32:10.170
Plus, you don't need to
worry about what to write.

32:13.510 --> 32:16.200
He denies plagiarizing
and keeps feeding me lies.

32:16.200 --> 32:18.730
I won't let him
steal my labor of love anymore.

32:18.790 --> 32:21.250
Come on, buddy!
This is the corporate world,

32:21.310 --> 32:23.040
not the martial world. Come on.

32:24.550 --> 32:25.720
Remember that beta software

32:25.720 --> 32:28.050
"Magic Code Novel" I mentioned last time?

32:28.160 --> 32:29.000
Give it a shot!

32:30.240 --> 32:31.970
They say the Magic Code Novel's

32:32.150 --> 32:34.790
AI interactive writing feature
already includes

32:34.790 --> 32:37.790
the Marvelous Heroes of Shenzhou
by Master Wen Ruian—

32:37.960 --> 32:41.480
the exact story you're adapting!

32:42.240 --> 32:43.200
See? It's practically made

32:43.200 --> 32:45.330
to fulfill your martial arts fantasy.

32:46.000 --> 32:47.270
Magic Code Novel...

33:40.830 --> 33:41.640
Wait, no!

33:43.510 --> 33:44.480
My draft!

33:49.720 --> 33:52.110
-Third Young Master!
-Third Young Master, wake up!

33:52.110 --> 33:53.480
Wake up, Third Young Master!

33:53.480 --> 33:54.550
Third Young Master.

33:54.550 --> 33:56.150
Third Young Master, wake up.

33:57.240 --> 34:00.750
-The Third Young Master is awake!
-The Third Young Master is awake!

34:00.750 --> 34:01.750
I remember now...

34:02.400 --> 34:04.000
Right before I arrived here,

34:04.310 --> 34:07.310
I wasn't just compiling
the Magic Codex Novel at home—

34:07.550 --> 34:09.810
I've lost a critical fragment of memory.

34:25.710 --> 34:27.150
This is too difficult!

34:29.760 --> 34:31.020
Why are you still here?

34:34.670 --> 34:35.760
Stop waiting.

34:35.760 --> 34:37.219
Your senior isn't coming.

34:37.480 --> 34:39.400
Ever since you brought up
the outline issue,

34:39.400 --> 34:40.360
he's vanished.

34:40.510 --> 34:42.760
He's clearly avoiding you.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.659
Come on, let's grab some food.

34:47.840 --> 34:48.699
I'll skip that.

34:49.230 --> 34:50.230
You go home first.

34:50.710 --> 34:52.239
I'll wait a bit longer here.

34:57.110 --> 34:58.070
Very well.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.380
I, unworthy Li Cai,

35:00.030 --> 35:01.290
will take my leave now.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.660
Do remember to eat something.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.050
Ugh, just my luck...

35:35.590 --> 35:36.990
What in the world is this?

36:10.880 --> 36:11.440
Hey,

36:12.670 --> 36:14.070
the materials are ready.

36:14.320 --> 36:16.320
I'll send them via the usual method.

36:16.960 --> 36:18.400
and regular gears

36:18.800 --> 36:20.260
won't make it past checks.

36:20.800 --> 36:23.460
Lucky you prepped
the special equipment for me.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.930
Don't worry, it's handled.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.000
Senior,

37:14.710 --> 37:15.770
what are you doing?

37:19.280 --> 37:20.680
Still on the clock, I see?

37:27.630 --> 37:28.890
Did you get these stuff

37:31.000 --> 37:33.360
secretly at the military forum event?

37:40.670 --> 37:42.200
What are you talking about?

37:42.480 --> 37:43.940
I don't understand a word.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.080
Oh, you don't understand...

37:50.670 --> 37:52.130
I'll call the police then.

37:53.000 --> 37:55.060
Let the police do the investigation.

37:56.030 --> 37:56.960
Enough games.

37:57.960 --> 38:00.000
Just name your price.

38:00.920 --> 38:01.710
Is it money,

38:02.480 --> 38:03.340
a new book deal,

38:04.230 --> 38:05.490
or authorship credit?

38:06.510 --> 38:07.800
It's all negotiable.

38:11.230 --> 38:13.090
My personal grievances can wait.

38:14.710 --> 38:17.370
But selling state secrets
to foreign entities?

38:19.320 --> 38:21.450
That's an entirely different matter.

38:44.880 --> 38:45.440
Let go.

38:46.510 --> 38:47.240
Give it to me.

38:49.280 --> 38:50.280
Release it now!

39:07.800 --> 39:08.550
Reset.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.070
It's him!

39:12.800 --> 39:13.800
If Li Nan has been

39:13.800 --> 39:15.480
in this storyworld

39:16.110 --> 39:17.570
since the day I arrived...

39:19.030 --> 39:21.090
I was willing to die to alter the plot,

39:21.440 --> 39:23.970
to make Yiren rush home
with reinforcements.

39:24.320 --> 39:26.250
Yet he still fell into an ambush...

39:27.230 --> 39:28.840
I diverted fate itself,

39:29.230 --> 39:31.030
but couldn't stop the massacre.

39:33.110 --> 39:33.880
Could it be that Li Nan

39:33.880 --> 39:35.540
twisted the narrative again?

39:36.360 --> 39:37.090
Moreover...

39:37.440 --> 39:41.070
Your parents weren't killed
by the Power Gang.

39:41.400 --> 39:43.230
When I gave my order
regarding the Xiao family,

39:43.230 --> 39:45.000
I ordered to only surround
the Xiao Residence, not to kill.

39:45.000 --> 39:47.670
But by the time the second group
of Power Gang forces arrived,

39:47.670 --> 39:51.190
the Xiao family's Sword Manor
had already been breached.

39:51.760 --> 39:54.030
The one
who slaughtered your Xiao family...

39:54.030 --> 39:56.690
must have come from
within your own Sword Manor.

39:57.030 --> 39:59.070
If the Sword Manor
had already been breached

39:59.070 --> 40:01.760
from within
before the Power Gang even arrived...

40:01.760 --> 40:04.150
then the ones who killed Mother and Father
must be different perpetrators.

40:04.150 --> 40:07.320
Could Li Nan have an accomplice
hidden within the Xiao family?

40:07.320 --> 40:09.190
What identity is he using now

40:09.510 --> 40:11.320
to infiltrate so deeply?

40:13.440 --> 40:14.760
Who... is he exactly?

40:28.070 --> 40:28.800
Big Brother.

40:31.320 --> 40:32.050
Big Brother!

40:41.960 --> 40:42.630
Yuhan,

40:43.800 --> 40:45.800
something's weighing on your mind.

40:46.230 --> 40:49.110
That day when the Xiao family
Sword Forge was besieged,

40:49.110 --> 40:50.670
I vowed to you that

40:51.110 --> 40:53.840
I would seek my father's
help to aid Huanhua Sect.

40:53.880 --> 40:55.080
But I never imagined,

40:55.920 --> 40:57.450
he'd hesitate and stand by,

40:57.880 --> 40:58.920
doing nothing.

41:01.400 --> 41:03.060
I've always felt I failed you.

41:07.190 --> 41:07.880
Yuhan,

41:08.710 --> 41:10.440
no matter what your father did,

41:11.440 --> 41:13.500
you'll always be my brother for life.

41:13.670 --> 41:15.760
Besides,
the Marrow-Disrupting Finger theory

41:15.760 --> 41:17.290
is still just speculation.

41:19.230 --> 41:20.360
Don't overthink it.

41:21.030 --> 41:23.160
Back when we 4 brothers swore our oath,

41:23.400 --> 41:24.130
I said to you:

41:25.840 --> 41:27.170
no matter what happens,

41:27.710 --> 41:29.170
no matter when it happens,

41:29.840 --> 41:33.670
you'll always be my Big Brother;
I'll follow you through thick and thin.

41:33.670 --> 41:35.800
I'll go with you back to the Hailin Sect

41:36.320 --> 41:38.780
to confront my father
and uncover the truth.

41:42.920 --> 41:43.630
Alright,

41:44.880 --> 41:47.540
it's better than letting
the doubt torment you.

41:48.440 --> 41:49.150
Wait for me to return.
